request.description:
Add a question to a section. Types: free_text, dichotomous, multiple_choice, numeric, single_choice. Types with options: multiple_choice, single_choice. The legacy type `matrix` is retired: sending it returns 400 INVALID_QUESTION_TYPE (messageCode anamnesis.invalidQuestionType).

Conditional display: set parentQuestionId (UUID of an eligible parent in the same section) and condition:
- Dichotomous parent: { "operator": "equals", "value": "yes" | "no" }
- Single choice parent: { "operator": "equals", "optionId": "<uuid>" }
- Multiple choice parent: { "operator": "includesAny", "optionIds": ["<uuid>"] }

Errors: 400 INVALID_QUESTION_TYPE, PARENT_NOT_ELIGIBLE, PARENT_MUST_BE_SAME_SECTION, INVALID_CONDITION, CONDITIONAL_DEPTH_EXCEEDED

